00:03:51.524 --> 00:03:57.964
pairs averaged 1.52 seconds at an estimated compute cost of $13,000 of a dollar.

00:03:58.484 --> 00:04:03.024
Latency stayed broadly consistent as matching variants rose from 4 to 400.

00:04:03.024 --> 00:04:10.024
Anirata Wikramarachi, solutions architect for bioinformatics products at CSIRO, said queering

00:04:10.024 --> 00:04:13.264
the data while it stays in compressed form is greatly beneficial.

